/Title (The Sinoe Building Climate Resilience Project brought together student leaders from ten schools across Sinoe County for a Leadership and Sustainability Training. At the core of the training was a practical sustainability plan, developed together with the studets in group sessions. The goal was simple: make sure these clubs keep going on their own.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3400 0 R
/Prev 3406 0 R
/Next 3419 0 R
>>
endobj
3414 0 obj
<<
/Title (Students were connected with key local partners to support collaboration and community engagement. A Sinoe Schools Climate Network was created to keep all clubs connected and sharing ideas beyond the project period. Clubs also received practical, locally relevant fundraising ideas to support activities like clean-ups and awareness campaigns.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3400 0 R
/Prev 3420 0 R
